WEBVTT

00:19.220 --> 00:22.100
Do not leave my sight 
for more than five minutes.

00:22.940 --> 00:24.790
What a funny joke.

00:24.790 --> 00:28.540
You know ladies need time 
to fix their makeup.

00:33.300 --> 00:35.660
<i>He got more guards?!</i>

00:37.100 --> 00:40.240
<i>And four of them, not counting Adam?!</i>

00:46.640 --> 00:50.460
<i>Could he trust me any less?!</i>

02:24.440 --> 02:26.010
It's Miss Raeliana. {raeliana himegimi yo}

02:26.010 --> 02:27.300
The one they all talk about? {uwasa no}

02:27.300 --> 02:28.230
That's her? {are ga}{hard to hear this one. Might be timed wrong}

02:31.340 --> 02:33.280
She's beautiful... {suteki na kata ne}

02:33.280 --> 02:35.710
<i>Everyone's looking at me.</i>

02:35.710 --> 02:37.720
Oh, my lord Duke.

02:38.320 --> 02:40.960
Congratulations on your engagement.

02:41.960 --> 02:45.780
Ah, Marquess Eriteal. Thank you.

02:46.440 --> 02:49.220
A pleasure to meet you, Miss McMillan.

02:50.220 --> 02:51.580
The pleasure is mine.

02:51.940 --> 02:54.240
My name is Raeliana McMillan.

02:54.840 --> 02:57.470
So that's Miss Raeliana McMillan?

02:57.800 --> 03:00.140
The one Duke Wynknight chose?

03:00.480 --> 03:03.470
I heard he'll be formally 
announcing their engagement here.

03:03.990 --> 03:07.750
Isn't Lady Vivian Shamal 
here tonight, as well?

03:08.310 --> 03:10.430
<i>Vivian Shamal...</i>

03:11.260 --> 03:13.690
She's a real vixen. {ep3 final}

03:14.050 --> 03:17.460
Dear me! What a beautiful young lady!

03:17.460 --> 03:22.970
I can see why the Duke and 
the Brooks household are at odds.

03:22.970 --> 03:26.800
It's no wonder you've seemed
 to be happy of late, sir.

03:26.800 --> 03:28.210
Have I really?

03:28.210 --> 03:31.500
<i>Yep, there's the Noah Wynknight smile.</i>

03:32.660 --> 03:36.990
Meeting this lady was indeed 
the greatest fortune I could ask for.

03:43.780 --> 03:46.980
Miss McMillan, may I have this dance?

03:46.980 --> 03:47.700
Huh?

03:48.010 --> 03:49.400
No, dance with me!

03:49.400 --> 03:50.240
No, me!

03:50.650 --> 03:53.140
<i>Right... Smile, smile...</i>

03:57.040 --> 03:58.740
I do apologize.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.490
Hey, did you see that?

04:01.490 --> 04:02.890
How wonderful!

04:01.490 --> 04:02.890
What a gentleman!

04:02.890 --> 04:04.510
That's the Duke for you!

04:04.510 --> 04:07.010
<i>He's acting! He's just acting!</i>

04:07.400 --> 04:13.030
<i>I mean, he's definitely the type who'd 
keep his girlfriend on a tight leash.</i>

04:13.320 --> 04:15.570
<i>Even for the novel's heroine,</i>

04:15.570 --> 04:18.480
<i>to be bound to 
a restrictive guy like this...</i>

04:18.480 --> 04:20.700
<i>I feel for Beatrice.</i>

04:23.740 --> 04:26.780
May I have this dance?

04:32.660 --> 04:33.900
With pleasure.

05:58.360 --> 06:02.680
Why do you look like a little village 
girl who's been sold off into marriage?

06:04.280 --> 06:09.180
How very like you to know 
so well how I feel inside.

06:09.180 --> 06:10.860
What are you talking about?

06:10.860 --> 06:13.820
I'm the one being held captive.

06:13.820 --> 06:17.220
<i>Excuse me?! You're enjoying 
the hell out of this!</i>

06:17.220 --> 06:19.190
Watch your expressions.

06:20.310 --> 06:23.040
Everyone will notice right away 
that you're my false fiancée

06:23.040 --> 06:26.140
if you keep making faces like that.

06:29.120 --> 06:30.710
You're such a cheat!

06:31.020 --> 06:33.280
What's the matter, blackmailer?

06:34.110 --> 06:37.060
What a thing to say to a lady!

06:37.060 --> 06:40.240
I wish everyone else could 
hear you talking like this!

06:41.140 --> 06:42.380
I wouldn't mind that.

06:42.720 --> 06:46.630
As a certain someone said, I <i>am</i> a cheat.

06:50.020 --> 06:51.890
Oh, dear. Pardon me.

06:52.720 --> 06:54.160
Oh?

07:07.270 --> 07:11.720
It appears you still need 
more practice, Raeliana.

07:17.270 --> 07:19.400
It would seem so.

07:21.290 --> 07:24.300
Oh, my! Your hairstyle is just lovely!

07:24.300 --> 07:25.940
And your dress is beautiful!

07:25.940 --> 07:27.720
Did you just buy those earrings?

07:27.720 --> 07:29.300
They suit you so well!

07:29.300 --> 07:32.300
<i>Nick is the same no matter where he goes.</i>

07:37.170 --> 07:41.080
<i>I keep getting the feeling 
someone's watching me...</i>

07:44.080 --> 07:46.060
<i>It's not Master Taylor or the other guards.</i>

07:47.760 --> 07:50.820
<i>With this many people here, 
I can't even guess who it is.</i>

08:02.920 --> 08:04.340
It's Lady Vivian.

08:04.340 --> 08:05.980
Lady Vivian...

08:05.980 --> 08:07.240
<i>Vivian?</i>

08:07.680 --> 08:10.540
<i>Of course! Vivian Shamal!</i>

08:14.670 --> 08:17.680
<i>I knew that name sounded familiar.</i>

08:17.680 --> 08:20.840
<i>She's a very important 
character in the novel.</i>

08:21.920 --> 08:24.740
<i>She tried everything in her power 
to appeal to Noah,</i>

08:24.740 --> 08:26.820
<i>but he wouldn't give her the time of day.</i>

08:27.330 --> 08:29.220
<i>Her heart broken,</i>

08:29.220 --> 08:32.490
<i>she accepted a timely marriage 
proposal from the king,</i>

08:32.900 --> 08:36.620
<i>and now she's undergoing her education 
as the only candidate for future queen.</i>

08:38.250 --> 08:43.100
<i>But once the novel's heroine, Beatrice, 
enters a relationship with Noah,</i>

08:44.080 --> 08:47.240
<i>Vivian tries to get 
between them at every step.</i>

08:49.100 --> 08:51.490
<i>She's basically positioned
 as the book's villainess.</i>

08:51.980 --> 08:53.000
<i>This is...</i>

08:54.760 --> 08:56.340
<i>Vivian Shamal.</i>

09:07.210 --> 09:10.570
Lady Vivian, I hope 
the evening finds you well.

09:11.090 --> 09:14.440
You are as beautiful 
as ever. How I envy you.

09:14.700 --> 09:18.540
<i>Wow, she definitely looks 
like a total villainess...</i>

09:19.910 --> 09:20.940
<i>Hang on.</i>

09:21.360 --> 09:25.740
<i>If she tried to get 
between Beatrice and Noah...</i>

09:25.740 --> 09:30.750
<i>Since I'm his fiancée now, 
does that mean I'll be her target?!</i>

09:31.200 --> 09:34.010
<i>Just dealing with Noah is bad enough!</i>

09:34.010 --> 09:37.530
<i>If I have her gunning for me too,
 I'm done for!</i>

09:38.620 --> 09:39.670
Raeliana...

09:40.000 --> 09:41.600
Y-Yes?

09:42.260 --> 09:43.960
Uh...

09:44.730 --> 09:46.270
What are you doing?

09:46.270 --> 09:48.520
Oh, nothing...

09:48.520 --> 09:51.090
My shoulders just felt a bit stiff.

09:51.090 --> 09:55.210
Do you remember the promise you made 
when we negotiated our contract?

09:56.520 --> 09:57.840
Promise?

09:58.550 --> 10:00.940
For as long as this farce goes on, {ep2 final}

10:00.940 --> 10:06.370
you will play your part as my 
fiancée whenever I need you to. {/ep2}

10:06.870 --> 10:08.250
Oh...

10:09.130 --> 10:11.440
And you need that right now?

10:12.080 --> 10:12.940
Yes.

10:13.560 --> 10:14.990
For that woman.

10:19.020 --> 10:23.910
Noah, are you still mad at me 
for stepping on your foot earlier?

10:24.380 --> 10:28.770
That's Vivian Shamal, right?! 
So does that mean...

10:28.770 --> 10:33.720
<i>He wants to throw me at 
her as a decoy so he can get away?!</i>

10:34.740 --> 10:37.540
I'm talking about the woman beside her.

10:37.790 --> 10:38.780
Huh?

10:40.080 --> 10:41.860
Freese Eriteal,

10:42.270 --> 10:44.540
the wife of Marquess Eriteal.

10:44.540 --> 10:46.800
Marquess Eriteal...

10:46.800 --> 10:48.300
<i>That guy with the mustache?</i>

10:49.350 --> 10:50.300
<i>That's his wife?!</i>

10:50.600 --> 10:52.200
<i>Not his daughter?!</i>

10:52.520 --> 10:55.710
There's a group that certain 
wives of old nobles are part of.

10:56.300 --> 10:58.520
What it's called and who's 
part of it are unknown.

10:58.940 --> 11:03.680
Only wives of high nobles who are friendly 
with each other are allowed to join.

11:04.480 --> 11:07.530
Because the high status of their 
husbands reaches them as well,

11:07.530 --> 11:11.320
the things these women discuss 
with each other affect the whole kingdom.

11:11.320 --> 11:14.820
At least, some joke that they do.

11:15.900 --> 11:17.040
Raeliana...

11:17.830 --> 11:21.500
I need you to receive an invitation
 to that group from her.

11:22.960 --> 11:24.270
I'm counting on you.

11:29.580 --> 11:32.640
I thought you doubted my intentions.

11:33.440 --> 11:38.190
If I were to join that group and 
tell them a mixture of fact and fiction,

11:38.190 --> 11:39.600
what would you do?

11:39.600 --> 11:40.780
Do as you please.

11:40.780 --> 11:44.600
It is my policy to use 
whatever I have at my disposal.

11:44.600 --> 11:47.600
<i>Who's using whom, exactly?</i>

11:48.930 --> 11:51.680
You owe me one after this.

11:52.050 --> 11:56.190
And it's going to be a <i>very</i> big favor!

11:56.190 --> 11:59.200
I intend to make sure you return that favor.

11:59.200 --> 12:01.420
Don't forget that.

12:01.720 --> 12:06.730
Unfortunately for you, I also use 
whatever I have at my disposal.

12:22.980 --> 12:25.470
Excuse me... May I have a plate?

12:26.260 --> 12:27.220
Of course.

12:36.360 --> 12:39.580
I-I'll bring something to wipe 
that off with at once!

12:39.580 --> 12:41.780
I-I'm so sorry!

12:41.780 --> 12:43.650
Don't worry about it.

12:43.650 --> 12:47.280
More importantly, 
we should clean off your hands.

12:48.770 --> 12:50.120
Right...

12:50.730 --> 12:52.680
<i>Plan successful!</i>

12:53.700 --> 12:55.600
Let's go to another room.

12:56.670 --> 12:58.930
So you are Miss McMillan?

13:05.980 --> 13:08.260
What an honor it is to meet you.

13:09.680 --> 13:11.780
<i>Oh, crap.</i>

13:13.990 --> 13:18.680
It is I who am honored to meet you, 
Lady Vivian Shamal.

13:18.680 --> 13:21.690
Oh, you know who I am?

13:22.960 --> 13:24.780
But of course.

13:24.780 --> 13:28.340
There is no one in this 
kingdom who doesn't know you.

13:28.340 --> 13:31.220
I have an urgent matter 
to attend to at the moment.

13:31.220 --> 13:33.210
Do forgive me, if you please.

13:35.100 --> 13:37.720
Let me bring something 
for you to wipe your hands with.

13:37.720 --> 13:40.670
No, this will require water to wash clean.

13:40.670 --> 13:43.320
Only my glove was soiled,

13:43.320 --> 13:46.970
but I fear having it on her hands 
will be inconvenient for my lady.

13:48.980 --> 13:51.080
My lady...

13:51.550 --> 13:54.980
You would be fine with simply 
wiping your hands, would you not?

13:54.980 --> 13:57.980
Y-Yes... That would be fine.

13:59.130 --> 14:02.230
<i>She's not going to be easy 
to deal with, is she?</i>

14:02.540 --> 14:06.500
Miss McMillan, I have heard much about you.

14:07.440 --> 14:10.420
They say you have 
remarkable academic talent.

14:10.830 --> 14:12.710
As a member of the Estota class,

14:12.710 --> 14:15.710
I'm sure you had little 
opportunity to study.

14:15.990 --> 14:20.200
<i>She just had to go out of her way to bring 
up that abolished class system.</i>

14:20.400 --> 14:23.210
<i>She really wants to stress 
that she's above me, doesn't she?</i>

14:24.360 --> 14:27.260
<i>No matter what age you live in, 
if someone throws down the gauntlet...</i>

14:28.480 --> 14:30.780
<i>It's common courtesy to pick it up.</i>

14:31.480 --> 14:32.740
My!

14:32.740 --> 14:34.980
What an honor it is to receive 
a compliment from you!

14:36.160 --> 14:37.730
You are correct.

14:37.730 --> 14:42.430
As part of the Estota class, 
I had few opportunities.

14:42.760 --> 14:45.110
But I'm sure learning even 
more difficult subjects

14:45.110 --> 14:49.240
in such a short time would
 have been challenging.

14:49.240 --> 14:51.410
To make up for my lack 
of experience and knowledge,

14:51.410 --> 14:55.800
I have devoted myself to my studies so that 
I won't shame the Duke's good name.

14:56.000 --> 15:01.760
But to receive such praise 
from you makes all the effort worthwhile!

15:02.100 --> 15:03.880
Well, how lovely.

15:06.580 --> 15:09.260
<i>Even a monkey could have
 solved those problems.</i>

15:09.580 --> 15:12.080
I had heard that many of the women of

15:12.080 --> 15:15.460
the Estota class carried 
themselves quite confidently.

15:15.460 --> 15:17.520
It appears that was true.

15:17.970 --> 15:20.520
<i>Her smile isn't reaching her eyes...</i>

15:20.520 --> 15:25.800
<i>So she's saying someone who's ranked 
lower should act more humble, huh?</i>

15:26.170 --> 15:29.940
Thanks to His Majesty, the status 
of women in society has risen.

15:29.940 --> 15:33.280
Current trends value a proactive attitude,

15:33.280 --> 15:38.180
especially among the younger generation,
 who are more perceptive of changing times.

15:38.780 --> 15:43.920
Though I'm sure those of the 
older generations find it undesirable...

15:45.160 --> 15:50.140
Please overlook this as just another 
part of the new age we live in.

15:50.140 --> 15:52.190
<i>Humble, my ass!</i>

15:52.190 --> 15:54.800
<i>What century does she 
think we're in, anyway?!</i>

15:59.680 --> 16:01.060
Lady Vivian...

16:01.430 --> 16:05.080
Miss McMillan, you may have academic talent,

16:05.080 --> 16:08.880
but it seems you still have much 
to learn about etiquette.

16:08.880 --> 16:11.210
It is my greatest shame.

16:11.210 --> 16:12.030
I—

16:12.030 --> 16:13.760
Well, well! I wondered who that was!

16:13.760 --> 16:15.650
If it isn't Lady Vivian!

16:16.570 --> 16:17.850
Nick?

16:17.850 --> 16:19.720
When did you get here?

16:20.240 --> 16:24.340
You have so little presence, 
I didn't even notice.

16:24.600 --> 16:26.840
Nick Maddox...

16:27.110 --> 16:30.550
Oh! I'm so honored that you remember me!

16:30.550 --> 16:33.670
I see you still manage to sneak around,

16:33.670 --> 16:36.280
despite having the physique of a bear.

16:36.280 --> 16:38.720
You're quite the little mouse.

16:38.720 --> 16:43.570
Oh, but I quite like mice. They're adorable.

16:43.570 --> 16:47.570
And much better than malicious 
little vixens who always put on airs.

16:47.570 --> 16:49.570


16:49.100 --> 16:52.660
When did you become friends 
with Miss McMillan?

16:52.660 --> 16:56.110
You two are quite the lovely match.
So very much alike.

16:56.110 --> 16:57.480
Ah... bitchoo!

16:59.840 --> 17:01.880
Oh, I'm so sorry!

17:01.880 --> 17:03.440
That sneeze came out of nowhere!

17:03.440 --> 17:06.680
I'm allergic to vixens, you see.

17:07.040 --> 17:08.840
Ah-bitchoo!

17:09.380 --> 17:12.120
<i>Allergic to vixens?!</i>

17:12.120 --> 17:14.630
How dare you?! I will not 
tolerate such rudeness!

17:14.630 --> 17:15.860
<i>Oh, right!</i>

17:15.850 --> 17:16.780
Whatever do you mean?

17:15.860 --> 17:17.720
Let's go wash your hands.

17:16.780 --> 17:21.140
I just thought perhaps there was 
a vixen out in the courtyard or something.

17:22.890 --> 17:24.870
<i>Thanks, Nick.</i>

17:22.890 --> 17:27.200
You had the nerve to interrupt 
when I was talking before, too!

17:29.890 --> 17:32.420
Let's wash your hands 
in that room over there.

17:32.420 --> 17:33.670
U-Um...

17:33.670 --> 17:34.770
Huh?

17:36.780 --> 17:41.490
Will those people be 
coming with us, as well?

17:53.640 --> 17:57.510
I'm sorry, but would you please 
leave us for the time being?

18:04.570 --> 18:07.350
Then could that lady knight over there...

18:07.350 --> 18:09.140
I am Ansley.

18:09.930 --> 18:10.840
All right.

18:10.840 --> 18:15.130
Could all of you but Dame Ansley 
please return to the ballroom?

18:16.950 --> 18:21.010
Please tell Noah that 
I'm with Marquess Eriteal's wife.

18:23.280 --> 18:24.660
I greatly appreciate it.

18:33.760 --> 18:36.320
Come along, my lady.

18:37.290 --> 18:42.410
<i>Adam Taylor is taking orders 
from someone </i>other<i> than our master?</i>

18:43.050 --> 18:44.370
Dame Ansley?

18:45.090 --> 18:47.270
Yes, right away!

18:57.020 --> 18:59.080
Please, use this.

19:00.610 --> 19:02.490
Thank you.

19:05.130 --> 19:09.160
My household may be of the nobility, 
but our territory is small.

19:09.160 --> 19:12.220
After being stricken by several 
disasters in recent years,

19:12.220 --> 19:14.840
some now call it a ghost town.

19:14.840 --> 19:18.300
I only came to the capital 
after I married the marquess,

19:18.300 --> 19:20.550
so I'm not used to things yet.

19:20.550 --> 19:24.350
<i>So that's why she was hanging 
out with Vivian Shamal.</i>

19:24.810 --> 19:26.320
I can relate.

19:27.160 --> 19:30.560
My circumstances also 
changed quite abruptly,

19:30.560 --> 19:32.560
and I struggled to get used to the change.

19:35.680 --> 19:37.560
It's been hard on you, hasn't it?

19:42.100 --> 19:45.090
I met your husband, the marquess, earlier.

19:45.090 --> 19:47.550
He's a very dignified man, isn't he?

19:48.730 --> 19:50.080
Yes...

19:50.830 --> 19:55.070
<i>Oh, crap! Maybe I shouldn't have said that!</i>

19:55.070 --> 19:58.850
<i>She does look at least two 
decades younger than him...</i>

19:58.850 --> 20:03.640
<i>Maybe she was forced to marry him 
for political reasons?!</i>

20:05.100 --> 20:07.240
<i>Wh-Wh-Wh-What do I do now?!</i>

20:07.240 --> 20:10.000
<i>Gotta change the subject! New topic!</i>

20:10.000 --> 20:11.680
B-By the way,

20:11.680 --> 20:15.600
I heard there's a group that 
all the noble wives are a part of.

20:15.850 --> 20:17.660
Oh... Yes.

20:17.660 --> 20:22.570
Many of the women at 
the ball tonight are members of it.

20:22.570 --> 20:24.110
I see.

20:24.110 --> 20:26.120
What sort of group is it?

20:26.120 --> 20:27.130
Huh?

20:27.130 --> 20:28.920
I'm a bit envious.

20:28.920 --> 20:33.390
I haven't had many opportunities 
to interact with other noblewomen.

20:33.390 --> 20:35.120
Miss McMillan...

20:35.130 --> 20:38.390
<i>Not that I ever wanted to 
in the first place.</i>

20:39.000 --> 20:41.000
Please, call me "Raeliana."

20:44.830 --> 20:47.570
In that case, um... Madam Raeliana...

20:47.570 --> 20:50.140
Would you like to join the group?

20:50.140 --> 20:51.290
What?

20:51.290 --> 20:52.240
I mean...

20:52.240 --> 20:57.120
It would be reassuring for me to 
have someone there who can help me, too.

20:57.120 --> 20:58.920
I really can?

20:58.920 --> 21:00.400
Yes, by all means.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.400
That makes me so happy!

21:02.680 --> 21:05.960
I hope we can be good friends from now on!

21:05.960 --> 21:07.450
I hope so, as well.

21:08.410 --> 21:12.160
In that case, I'll send you 
an invitation in the coming days.

21:12.160 --> 21:14.060
Thank you so much!

21:14.060 --> 21:15.620
<i>That was a cinch!</i>

21:15.620 --> 21:17.880
<i>And now Noah owes me one!</i>

21:17.880 --> 21:20.380
<i>What should I ask him to do?</i>

21:20.380 --> 21:23.110
Well, shall we return to the ballroom?

21:23.110 --> 21:24.300
Yes.

21:30.460 --> 21:31.730
What?!

21:33.290 --> 21:34.640
A fire?!

21:35.400 --> 21:37.220
<i>I don't smell anything burning.</i>

21:37.220 --> 21:40.150
<i>So it's not a fire, 
but a deliberate smokescreen?!</i>

21:40.150 --> 21:42.730
Miss McMillan! Are you all right?!

21:42.730 --> 21:44.560
Miss McMillan!

21:45.230 --> 21:47.240
Dame Ansley!

21:48.770 --> 21:51.410
<i>I can't breathe... Noah...</i>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Episode Five</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Why Raeliana Was Taken Away</b>
